## 3. SUPERFICIES Y FORMA

La profundidad sale de **sombra + contraste de fondo**, no de bordes.

| Pieza | Clases |
|---|---|
| Card / sección (sustituye a FormSection) | `rounded-2xl bg-card p-5 shadow-float sm:p-6` — sin `border` |
| Card de anuncio en lista | `rounded-2xl bg-card p-4 shadow-float transition-shadow duration-200 hover:shadow-[0_8px_24px_oklch(0.29_0.05_265/0.12)]` |
| Card seleccionada (sincronizada con mapa) | añade `ring-2 ring-primary/40` |
| Input / buscador | `h-10 rounded-xl bg-card shadow-soft border-0 px-3.5` + icono `Search` `text-muted-foreground` |
| Contenedor segmentado / filtros | `inline-flex gap-1 rounded-full bg-card p-1 shadow-soft` |
| Opción del segmentado | `rounded-full px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground` · activa: `bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground` |
| Badge | `rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium` |
| Botón secundario en card ("Ver") | `rounded-full bg-muted px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-accent` |
| Well / zona hundida | `rounded-2xl bg-surface-sunken shadow-inset-soft` |

Sombras permitidas: `shadow-soft`, `shadow-float`, `shadow-primary` (solo sobre
elementos `bg-primary`), `shadow-inset-soft`. Nada de `shadow-lg/xl/2xl`.

### Botón (`components/ui/button.tsx`)
Edita las variantes `cva`, no crees otro botón:
- base: `rounded-full` en lugar de `rounded-lg`
- `default`: `bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-primary hover:bg-primary/90`
- `secondary`: `bg-card text-foreground shadow-soft hover:bg-accent`
- `outline`: `bg-transparent border border-border hover:bg-card hover:shadow-soft`
- `ghost`: `hover:bg-card/70`
Mantén `focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50` y `active:translate-y-px`.

